  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "A descending chipper in three segments: 800 m run, 60 burpee box jump overs, 50 pull-ups and 40 squats; then 600 m, 30, 25 chest-to-bar and 20 heavier squats; then 400 m, 15, 12 bar muscle-ups and 10 squat cleans at the heaviest bar. Honours Deputy Andrew Nunez of the San Bernardino County Sheriff's Department, killed responding to a domestic violence call in 2025. Three loads on one bar, so plan the plate changes.",
